codex
The first implementation compiles, but the full self-test exposed a performance issue in the relabelling audit: the canonicalizer is doing far more equivalent rotations than necessary. I’m tightening that normalization before judging the gates; the generator and verifier themselves are already deterministic and exact.
diff --git a/gen_1911_05032.py b/gen_1911_05032.py
