codex
Medium was also defeated (2/3), and the first hard-preset oracle found a valid partition. The family is behaving as a Track B compression task—some models recognize and execute the quadratic-character route—so the remaining allowed escalations test whether the fixed answer/operation caps leave any defensible held level.
