codex
Implemented and verified the Track B generator for [arXiv:1911.05032](https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.05032).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `hard`, with `n=149`, 148 universe elements and 5,920 triples.
- All nine gates pass.
- Random guessing: 0/200,000.
- Five heuristic attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference DPLL: 8/8 solved, as expected for Track B.
- Bare oracle hardening: held at 0/3.
- G9: hinted 2/3, placebo 3/3; documented as prompt-sensitive.
- Answer: 489 characters, 148 atoms, 222 intended operations.

Deliverables:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1911.05032/gen_1911_05032.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1911.05032/selftest_report.json)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1911.05032/README.md)
- [Bare hardening transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1911.05032/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1911.05032/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1911.05032/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The submission validator passed gates, interface, native-domain checks, emission, and 20/20 canonical-key diversity. Only its final Git commit/push wrapper failed because the surrounding checkout is not a Git repository. Temporary G9 scratch directories were removed after preserving their transcripts.
